2026-07-27T11:19:22.3338879Z i /tmp/RtmpYFuTv1/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:19:22.3339384Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:19:22.3339982Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:19:22.3340503Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:19:22.3341326Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:19:22.3342894Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:19:22.3344549Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
